                "Vinylid-Knap VK-4 already has autoclave A-3 sitting at 8.6 MPa shell, two-point-six "
                "above the 6.0 MPa permit. Initiator still meters 4.2 L/h inside a 5.5 L/h pump envelope, "
                "so a pump-first cruise would hold VDF at 18.0 t/h. Binding the PT instead chops monomer "
                "18.0 -> 11.0. The agitator stuffing box stays silent on both publishers until AE later in the raster.",